---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Experience — Luis Meyehen Paz"
  description="Cloud and data platform engineering — impact-first experience log."
  session="journalctl"
  footPrompt="$ journalctl -u luis@cloud --no-pager ▮"
>
  <main class="screen sess-main">
    <div class="container screen-inner">
      <div class="screen-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">journalctl · experience</p>
        <h2>Seven years, three platform generations.</h2>
        <p>Impact first, responsibilities second — the strongest signal of each role leads.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="exp-list">
        <article class="exp-row">
          <span class="meta">10/2023 — now</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Interbank <span class="exp-role">· Cloud Platform Engineer</span></h3>
            <p class="exp-impact">→ Built a self-service variable catalog (FastAPI + React) and reusable pipeline templates so Data Science teams ship ML pilots without waiting on infra.</p>
            <p class="exp-detail">CI/CD in GitHub Actions &amp; Bitbucket · CDK and CloudFormation · SageMaker ECR images · MCP tooling and agent workflows · monitoring via Step Functions, Glue, Athena, QuickSight.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="exp-row">
          <span class="meta">08/2022 — 10/2023</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Prisma Medios de Pago <span class="exp-role">· AWS Data Platform Engineer</span></h3>
            <p class="exp-impact">→ Migrated platform IaC from CDK to Terraform and built event-driven ingestion (SQS · SNS · EventBridge) with automated data-quality checks.</p>
            <p class="exp-detail">Large-scale ingestion into the enterprise Data Lake on S3 · Salesforce API integration · Python, Step Functions, Lambda, Glue, EMR, Athena.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="exp-row">
          <span class="meta">10/2021 — 08/2022</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Tiendanube <span class="exp-role">· Data Platform Engineer</span></h3>
            <p class="exp-impact">→ Designed Lakehouse ETL with Glue and Databricks, opening SQL-based access across teams through Trino.</p>
            <p class="exp-detail">ETL pipeline ownership · Lakehouse architecture · Databricks and Trino ingestion for the company platform.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <p class="meta" style="margin-top: 20px;">Earlier roles: Walmart Argentina · Tsoft · Monsun · Dthink — full detail in the CV.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
